#: content/hardware.md:142
msgid "Slimbook"
msgstr "စလင်းဘွတ်ခ်"

#: content/hardware.md:144
msgid ""
"SLIMBOOK was born in 2015 with the idea of being the best brand in the "
"computer market with GNU / Linux (although it is also verified the absolute "
"compatibility with Microsoft Windows). They assemble computers searching for "
"excellent quality and warranty service, at a reasonable price. So much so, "
"that in 2018 they were awarded Best Open Source Service / Solution Provider "
"at the OpenExpo Europe 2018."
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:152
msgid "Star Labs"
msgstr "စတားလပ်ဘ်"

#: content/hardware.md:154
msgid ""
"Star Labs offers a range of laptops designed and built specifically for "
"Linux. Two version of their laptop are offered: the Star Lite Mk III 11-inch "
"and the Star LabTop Mk IV 13-inch."
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:160
msgid "Tuxedo"
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:162
msgid "Tuxedo builds tailor-made hardware and all this with Linux!"
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:164
msgid ""
"TUXEDO Computers are individually built computers/PCs and notebooks which "
"are fully Linux compatible, i. e. Linux hardware in tailor-made suit."
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:166
msgid ""
"All TUXEDO devices are delivered in such a way that you only have to unpack, "
"connect and switch them on. All the computers and notebooks are assembled "
"and installed in-house, not outsourced."
msgstr ""

#: content/hardware.md:168
msgid ""
"They provide you with self-programmed driver packages, support, installation "
"scripts and everything around our hardware, so that every hardware component "
"really works."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0 content/products.md:0
msgid "Plasma"
msgstr "ပလက်စမာ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Plasma is a Desktop"
msgstr "ပလက်စမာသည် ဒက်စ်တော့ပ်ဖြစ်သည်"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Plasma logo"
msgstr "ပလက်စမာ လိုဂို"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Plasma is KDE's desktop environment. Simple by default, powerful when needed."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Get Plasma for your device"
msgstr "သင်၏စက်အတွက် ပလက်စမာ ရယူပါ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Buy a device with Plasma"
msgstr "ပလက်စမာဖြင့် စက်တစ်လုံးဝယ်ယူလိုက်ပါ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "About Plasma 5.22"
msgid "About Plasma 5.24"
msgstr "ပလက်စမာ ၅.၂၂ အကြောင်း"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Plasma 5.24 improves in looks, ease of use and consistency."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Latest Release: Plasma 5.24"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "See Announcements"
msgstr "ကြေညာချက်များ ကြည့်မည်"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Simple by default"
msgstr "နဂိုရိုးရှင်း"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Plasma is designed to be easy to use."
msgstr "အသုံးပြုလွယ်ကူစေရန်အတွက် ပလက်စမာကို ဒီဇိုင်းဆွဲထားသည်။"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Launcher"
msgstr "လောင်ချာ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"The Plasma Launcher lets you quickly and easily launch applications, but it "
"can do much more -- convenient tasks like bookmarking applications, "
"searching for documents as you type, or navigating to common places help you "
"getting straight to the point. With a history of recently started programs "
"and opened files, you can return to where you left off. It even remembers "
"previously entered search terms so you don't have to."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot Plasma with the launcher open"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "System Tray"
msgstr "စစ်စတမ်ထရေး"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot Plasma with the system tray open"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Connect to your WiFi network; change the volume; switch to the next song or "
"pause a video; access an external device; change the screen layout. All "
"these and a lot more--directly from the system tray.\n"
"To conserve the focus on what you're currently doing, any icon can be hidden "
"if you like. Inactive icons hide themselves unless you tell them to stay "
"where they are.\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "အသိပေးချက်များ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot Plasma with a notification"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"See active tasks and recent actions; read new e-mails; quickly reply to "
"messages; see track changes or low battery notice; check for updates; "
"interact with recently moved files or screenshots. Or enter \"Do Not Disturb"
"\" mode to concentrate on your work."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Discover"
msgstr "ဒစ်(စ)ကာဗာ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Discover lets you manage the applications installed in your computer. "
"Updating, removing or installing an application is only one click away. "
"Supports [Flatpak](https://flatpak.org/), [Snaps](https://snapcraft.io/"
"store) and the applications available in your Linux distribution."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Powerful when needed"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Plasma is made to stay out of the way as it helps you get things done. But "
"under its light and intuitive surface, it's a powerhouse. So you're free to "
"choose ways of usage right as you need them and when you need them."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "KRunner"
msgstr "ကေရန်နာ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"KRunner is the launcher built into the Plasma desktop. While its basic "
"function is to launch programs from a sort of mini-command-line, its "
"functionality can be extended by \"runners\" to assist the user to "
"accomplish a lot of tasks. From opening folders and files to calculations "
"and currency conversions or even controlling your music player application - "
"there are so many things right at your fingertips."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot Plasma with KRunner"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "စစ်စတမ်ဆက်တင်များ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Your Plasma desktop is very flexible and can be configured just how you like "
"it using the System Settings app. Easily manage hardware, software, and "
"workspaces all in one place: Keyboard, Printer, Languages, Desktop Themes, "
"Fonts, Networks..."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot: Plasma system settings"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Professional Applications"
msgstr "ပရော်ဖက်ရှင်နယ် အပ္ပလီကေးရှင်းများ"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Screenshot of KDenlive in Plasma"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"[Krita](https://krita.org) is an application used by many artists that gives "
"to everyone the opportunity to draw concept art, textures, matte paintings, "
"illustrations and comics. [Kdenlive](https://kdenlive.org) is a professional "
"tool that enables everyone to do non-linear video editing. [DigiKam](https://"
"www.digikam.org) is an advanced open-source digital photo management "
"application that provides a comprehensive set of tools for importing, "
"managing, editing, and sharing photos and raw files."
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Customizable"
msgstr ""

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"With Plasma the user is king. Not happy with the color scheme? Change it! "
"Want to have your panel on the left edge of the screen? Move it! Don't like "
"the font? Use a different one! Download custom widgets in one click and add "
"them to your desktop or panel."
msgstr ""
"ပလက်စမာနှင့်ဆို အသုံးပြုသူသည် ဘုရင်ဖြစ်သည်။ အရောင်အစီအစဥ်ပြပုံကို မကြိုက်ဘူးလား။ ပြောင်းလိုက်ပါ။ သင်၏ပန်နယ်ကို "
"စခရင်၏ဘယ်အစွန်းတွင်ထားလိုပါသလား။ ရွေ့လိုက်ပါ။ ဖောင့်မကြိုက်ဘူးလား။ အခြားတစ်ခုသုံးလိုက်ပါ။ တစ်ချက်တည်းနှိပ်၍ "
"ကိုယ်ပိုင်ဓလေ့ဝစ်ဂျတ်များကိုဒေါင်းလုတ်ဆွဲပြီး သင်၏ပန်နယ် သို့မဟုတ် ဒက်စ်တော့ပ်သို့ ထည့်လိုက်ပါ။"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid "Dark Theme"
msgstr "အမှောင်သင်း"

#: content/plasma-desktop.md:0
msgid ""
"Give your eyes some rest by switching Plasma and its applications to a built-"
"in dark theme."
